        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-06-09T01:55:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Kratos13\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/65b543/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Kratos13:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Feel so bad for Handelabra. &nbsp;Toughest decks to program ever with probably triple the development cost for only $1.99 (free for Season Pass 1)? &nbsp;At least two of them have kids to feed!&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The price is great, for those who just want the mini pack.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I would be actually sympathetic if attempting to downlod this part of Season Pass 1 hadn't removed all of season pass 1 from my Android tablet.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Well, looks like I'm not unlocking Omni-U or Santa Guise for a while.</p>",
