        "created_at": "2016-06-09T15:30:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My first game against Wager Master, with 4 heroes (Guise, Captain Cosmic, Omni-U, Skyscraper) in Omni-IV:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Start of game:</p><p>Wageling</p><p>Wageling</p><p>Wageling</p><p>Wageling</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Lose the game before doing anything. &nbsp;</p><p><span>What are the odds? &nbsp;Makes me wonder... easter egg of some sort?</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
